# Chatora Environment Configuration
# ==================================
# Chatora is divided into two distinct workspaces: client (frontend) and server (backend).
# The root directory does not consume environment variables directly.
#
# Please configure environment variables in their respective subdirectories:
# - Frontend: client/.env.example -> client/.env
# - Backend:  server/.env.example -> server/.env
#
# For details, refer to the project README.md.
